.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-line size-5 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"></path></svg><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Grapheur</h2><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Tracez sin, paraboles, exponentielles. Survolez pour lire un point.</p></article><article class="space-y-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sigma size-5 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 7V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.4.8l4.5 6a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.4l-4.5 6a.5.5 0 0 0 .4.8H17a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2"></path></svg><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Formules sous la main</h2><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Pythagore, discriminant, dérivées, Thalès — le minimum utile, bien écrit.</p></article></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16"><div class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">Programme</p><h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight">Cours en une séance</h2></div><a href="https://hds-lsm8bnw85o1c-6014-4687i.grok-code-wild.hades-www.grok-sandbox.com/cours" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,box-shadow,transform,opacity] duration-150 ease-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/40 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:scale-[0.96] min-h-11 text-foreground hover:bg-muted h-11 px-4">Tous les cours<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><a href="https://hds-lsm8bnw85o1c-6014-4687i.grok-code-wild.hades-www.grok-sandbox.com/cours/fractions" class="group flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-card p-5 shadow-[var(--shadow-border)] transition-[box-shadow,transform] duration-150 hover:shadow-[var(--shadow-border-hover)]"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide bg-muted text-muted-foreground">6e</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide bg-primary/10 text-primary">Nombres</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-medium tracking-tight group-hover:text-primary">Fractions : simplifier, additionner</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Une fraction est un partage. On apprend à la réduire, puis à additionner deux parts d’un même tout.</p><p class="mt-4 text-xs tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">12<!-- --> min</p></a><a href="https://hds-lsm8bnw85o1c-6014-4687i.grok-code-wild.hades-www.grok-sandbox.com/cours/relatifs" class="group flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-card p-5 shadow-[var(--shadow-border)] transition-[box-shadow,transform] duration-150 hover:shadow-[var(--shadow-border-hover)]"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide bg-muted text-muted-foreground">5e</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide bg-primary/10 text-primary">Nombres</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-medium tracking-tight group-hover:text-primary">Nombres relatifs</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Positifs, négatifs, zéro. La droite graduée range tout, et l’addition devient un déplacement.</p><p class="mt-4 text-xs tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">10<!-- --> min</p></a><a href="https://hds-lsm8bnw85o1c-6014-4687i.grok-code-wild.hades-www.grok-sandbox.com/cours/pythagore" class="group flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-card p-5 shadow-[var(--shadow-border)] transition-[box-shadow,transform] duration-150 hover:shadow-[var(--shadow-border-hover)]"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide bg-muted text-muted-foreground">4e</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide bg-primary/10 text-primary">Géométrie</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-medium tracking-tight group-hover:text-primary">Théorème de Pythagore</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Dans un triangle rectangle, le carré de l’hypoténuse égale la somme des carrés des deux autres côtés.</p><p class="mt-4 text-xs tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">14<!-- --> min</p></a><a href="https://hds-lsm8bnw85o1c-6014-4687i.grok-code-wild.hades-www.grok-sandbox.com/cours/equations-1er" class="group flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-card p-5 shadow-[var(--shadow-border)] transition-[box-shadow,transform] duration-150 hover:shadow-[var(--shadow-border-hover)]"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide bg-muted text-muted-foreground">3e</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide bg-primary/10 text-primary">Algèbre</span></div><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-medium tracking-tight group-hover:text-primary">Équations du premier degré</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Isoler l’inconnue e